  "question": {
    "text": "A sample of $\\mathrm{MgCO}_3$ is dissolved in dil. $\\mathrm{HCl}$ and the solution is neutralized with ammonia and buffered with $\\mathrm{NH} \\mathrm{Cl}_4 /$ $\\mathrm{NH}_4 \\mathrm{OH}$. Disodium hydrogen phosphate reagent is added to the resulting solution. A white precipitate is formed. What is the formula of the precipitate?",
